---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About · Ujwal Ramesh Karajgikar" description="Business Analyst & Product Designer at Fortunesoft IT Innovations: translating AI product requirements into shippable systems." current="about">
  <div class="page about-page">
    <!-- Hero - Minimal, integrated -->
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-label">About</h1>
        <h1>Business Analyst & Product Designer</h1>
        <p class="lead">Operating at the intersection of product, design, and AI engineering — translating ambiguous AI requirements into shippable systems across FinTech, Healthcare, and Life Sciences.</p>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Location</span> Bengaluru, India</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Role</span> BA & Product Designer</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Focus</span> AI/ML Products, FinTech, Healthcare</span>
          <span class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Open to</span> Senior BA / Product Designer roles</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn-primary">View Resume</a>
          <a href="mailto:ukarajgikar@gmail.com" class="btn btn-secondary">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Impact Metrics - Compact -->
    <section class="section stats-section" aria-labelledby="stats-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title">Impact</h2>
      <dl class="stats-grid">
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">~1,000</span><span class="stat-label">Investors migrated</span></dt>
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">12</span><span class="stat-label">Months to production</span></dt>
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">3</span><span class="stat-label">Change requests</span></dt>
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">10s → 0.8s</span><span class="stat-label">Signing latency</span></dt>
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">$1.5k → <$800</span><span class="stat-label">Monthly cloud cost</span></dt>
        <dt class="stat"><span class="stat-value">3</span><span class="stat-label">Change requests</span></dt>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Career Timeline - Innovative vertical layout -->
    <section class="section timeline-section" aria-labelledby="timeline-heading">
      <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
      <dl class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <time class="timeline-marker" datetime="2025-09">Sep 2025 — Present</time>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Business Analyst & Product Designer</h3>
            <p class="org">Fortunesoft IT Innovations · Bengaluru · On-Site</p>
            <p>Translating complex requirements into actionable solutions for FinTech, Healthcare and Life Sciences. Leading requirements, Jira workflows, wireframes, and change-request management on Horizon (live) and Adapter (UAT).</p>
            <ul class="highlights">
              <li>~1,000 investors migrated on Horizon</li>
              <li>12 months kickoff → production</li>
              <li>3 change requests delivered</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <time class="timeline-marker" datetime="2022-11">Nov 2022 – Jan 2025</time>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Brand Development Lead</h3>
            <p class="org">Siggraph BNMIT · Student Club · On-Site</p>
            <p>Grew social media by 200%, launched merchandise, organized major events.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <time class="timeline-marker" datetime="2023-06">Jun 2023 – Jul 2024</time>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Web Developer</h3>
            <p class="org">IEEE CAS Bangalore · Remote</p>
            <p>Created and optimized WordPress pages, managing content and improving website accessibility.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <time class="timeline-marker" datetime="2023-09">Sep – Oct 2023</time>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>Cloud & DevOps Intern</h3>
            <p class="org">Subhanu Technologies · On-Site</p>
            <p>Automation scripts with Ansible and Terraform, AWS and Linux fundamentals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Principles - Integrated inline -->
      <div class="principles-inline">
        <h3>How I Work</h2>
        <ul class="principles-list">
          <li><strong>Clarity Before Code</strong> — Backend-heavy systems hide risk in edge cases. I turn open questions into agreed scenarios before build.</li>
          <li><strong>Make Status Visible</strong> — Every handoff shows where it stands in product and Jira, not in messages that get missed.</li>
          <li><strong>Keep Scope Honest</strong> — Infrastructure and new ideas become visible change requests with estimates.</li>
          <li><strong>Write It Down</strong> — Requirements, flows, and manuals are living documents with version history.</li>
          <li><strong>Plan Around Dependencies</strong> — Specs, credentials, test environments from third parties tracked as dated risks.</li>
          <li><strong>Prototype to Align</strong> — Wireframes and prototypes keep ML engineers, infra, and designers aligned.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Community & Learning - Compact -->
      <section class="community-compact">
        <h3>Community & Learning</h3>
        <ul class="community-list">
          <li><strong>Think Fast Talk Smart</strong> — Matt Abrahams' Stanford GSB podcast; applied to workshops, UAT, client calls.</li>
          <li><strong>Siggraph BNMIT — Brand Lead</strong> — Grew social 200%, launched merch, organized events.</li>
          <li><strong>IEEE CAS Bangalore</strong> — Web Developer, WordPress optimization, accessibility.</li>
          <li><strong>BNMIT Adventure Club</strong> — Treks across Karnataka, TCS World 10K 2025.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Certificates - Compact -->
      <section class="certs-compact">
        <h3>Certificates</h3>
        <ul class="certs-list">
          <li><strong>Google Cybersecurity</strong> — Coursera, Dec 2024–Jan 2025 — Linux, SQL, Python, SIEM (Splunk)</li>
          <li><strong>Google Data Analytics</strong> — Coursera, Jul–Aug 2023 — Sheets, SQL, Tableau, R</li>
          <li><strong>Continuous Learning</strong> — Think Fast Talk Smart (Stanford GSB), eval-driven development, AI-assisted workflows</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Stack - Compact with proficiency dots -->
      <section class="stack-compact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Tools & Stack</h2>
        <dl class="stack-compact-list">
          <dt>AI/ML</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag high">Python</span><span class="tag">PyTorch</span><span class="tag">HuggingFace</span><span class="tag">LangChain</span><span class="tag">RAG</span><span class="tag">Eval Frameworks</span><span class="tag">Guardrails</span><span class="tag">Embeddings</span><span class="tag">Vector DBs</span></dt>
          <dt>AI Tools</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag">Claude</span><span class="tag">ChatGPT</span><span class="tag">Gemini</span><span class="tag">OpenCode</span><span class="tag">Cursor</span><span class="tag">VS Code</span><span class="tag">Antigravity</span></dt>
          <dt>Languages</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><span class="tag">TypeScript</span><span class="tag">Java</span><span class="tag">SQL</span><span class="tag">R</span></dt>
          <dt>Web</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag">HTML</span><span class="tag">CSS</span><span class="tag">JS</span><span class="tag">TS</span><span class="tag">React</span><span class="tag">Next.js</span><span class="tag">Supabase</span><span class="tag">Firebase</span><span class="tag">Material UI</span></dt>
          <dt>DevOps</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag">Git</span><span class="tag">GitHub</span><span class="tag">WSL</span><span class="tag">AWS</span><span class="tag">Docker</span><span class="tag">K8s</span><span class="tag">Terraform</span><span class="tag">Ansible</span><span class="tag">Linux</span></dt>
          <dt>Analytics</dt>
          <dd><span class="tag">Jira</span><span class="tag">Confluence</span><span class="tag">Excel</span><span class="tag">Miro</span><span class="tag">Figma</span></dt>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <!-- Projects - Compact cards -->
      <section class="projects-compact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Projects</h2>
        <ul class="projects-list">
          <li><strong>Kelsa</span> — Visual task management for students · Next.js, Supabase, Vercel</li>
          <li><strong>Logit</span> — Social media for dev logs · Next.js, Firebase, Vercel</li>
          <li><strong>Sync</span> — Voice-to-text + AI summarization · Next.js, Gemini AI, Web Speech API</li>
          <li><strong>This Portfolio</span> — Astro, chat agent, search, dark mode, print CSS</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Testimonials - Compact -->
      <section class="testimonials-compact">
        <blockquote class="testimonial">"This is exactly what we talked about wanting — all those little things where you think, 'I wish they had this.'"<footer>— Client Leadership, Horizon</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote>"Ujwal translates ambiguous needs into precise specs. Bridges business and engineering exceptionally."<footer>— Engineering Lead, Horizon</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote>"Rare combination of BA rigor and product design sensibility. Doesn't just document — shapes product."<footer>— Product Lead, Adapter</footer></blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Availability CTA -->
      <footer class="about-footer">
        <div class="availability">
          <strong>Open to Senior BA / Product Designer roles</span> — Bengaluru · On-site or Hybrid
          <div class="cta-group">
            <a href="mailto:ukarajgikar@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">Email Me</a>
            <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary">Resume</a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/ujwal-karajgikar" class="btn">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ujwalrk-fsit/ujwalrk" class="btn">GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>